  "notes": "A patch sheet: library synths are silent in Synth Patch, so this shows the patch rather than playing it. Press **Run / Stop** on the DFAM. Its Pitch output plays the Matriarch's first two oscillators, a step at a time, and its Trigger Out fires both Matriarch envelopes, so the two play the same pattern. The DFAM's VCA output goes into the Matriarch's delay, so the drums echo with the bassline. Knob positions are a starting point; tune the DFAM's Seq Pitch knobs for the notes."
